  giverName: "C\xE2bir Usta"
  giverPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  giverLines:
  - "\xC7\u0131rak, defterime su s\u0131\xE7ram\u0131\u015F; \xFC\xE7 sat\u0131r\u0131n
    kelimeleri silinmi\u015F."
  - "\xD6nce masadaki g\xF6zlem kartlar\u0131na bak: kazanda kendi g\xF6rd\xFCklerin.
    Sonra sat\u0131rlar\u0131 tamamla."
  deliveryLines:
  - "Usta defteri kald\u0131rd\u0131: \"Sat\u0131rlar yerine oturdu. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    adland\u0131rmay\u0131 \xF6\u011Frendin.\""
  hintText: "Kelimelere bak: birle\u015Fmek, ayr\u0131\u015Fmak, yanmak."
